<view class="page backup-page">
  <view class="backup-reminder">联系人只保存在当前手机。建议定期导出加密备份，换手机、清理微信数据或恢复旧备份前先备份最新数据。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="app-state" role="status">{{busyMessage}}</view>
  <view class="backup-summary"><view>{{contacts}} 位联系人 · {{relationships}} 条关系</view><view>小程序缓存：{{storageLabel || '读取中…'}}（所有账号合计，不含头像文件）</view><view>当前头像文件：{{avatarSizeLabel}}</view><view>上次备份：{{lastBackup}}</view></view>
  <view class="app-state app-state--warning" wx:if="{{backupWarning}}">{{backupWarning}}</view>
  <view class="app-state app-state--warning" wx:if="{{storageWarning}}">本机缓存接近容量上限，请先备份。</view>
  <view class="app-state app-state--error" wx:if="{{infoError}}">{{infoError}}<button class="app-action" bindtap="retryInfo">重试统计</button></view>
  <view class="section-title">导出加密备份</view>
  <view class="backup-section">
    <input disabled="{{busy}}" password="{{!showExportPassword}}" value="{{exportPassword}}" bindinput="exportPasswordInput" placeholder="设置至少10位备份密码" maxlength="64" />
    <input disabled="{{busy}}" password="{{!showExportPassword}}" value="{{exportPasswordConfirm}}" bindinput="exportPasswordConfirmInput" placeholder="再次输入备份密码" maxlength="64" />
    <view class="password-hint"><text wx:if="{{exportPasswordConfirm && exportPassword !== exportPasswordConfirm}}" class="password-mismatch">两次输入不一致</text><button class="ui-link" bindtap="toggleExportPassword">{{showExportPassword ? '隐藏密码' : '显示密码'}}</button></view>
    <button class="primary-button" bindtap="exportData" disabled="{{busy || !exportPassword || exportPassword !== exportPasswordConfirm}}" loading="{{busy}}">生成并分享备份文件</button>
    <button wx:if="{{exportReady}}" class="secondary-button" bindtap="retryShare" disabled="{{busy}}">重新分享已生成文件</button>
    <text wx:if="{{exportReady}}">{{backupUnsaved ? '已生成、尚未分享保存' : '已生成并分享'}}：{{exportName}}</text>
    <text wx:if="{{recordWarning}}">{{recordWarning}}</text>
    <text>密码不会上传到服务器。应用内仅保留本账号最近生成的临时文件，新生成会替换它；请先把备份另存到安全位置并记住密码。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="section-title">从文件恢复</view>
  <view class="backup-section">
    <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="chooseFile" disabled="{{busy}}">选择备份文件</button>
    <text wx:if="{{selectedName}}">{{selectedName}}</text>
    <input disabled="{{busy}}" password value="{{importPassword}}" bindinput="importPasswordInput" placeholder="输入备份密码" maxlength="64" />
    <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="inspect" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !selectedPath}}">查看备份内容</button>
  </view>
  <view class="backup-section preview" wx:if="{{preview}}">
    <view class="preview-title">恢复预览</view>
    <view><text>当前手机</text><text>{{preview.currentContacts}} 位联系人 · {{preview.currentRelationships}} 条关系</text></view>
    <view><text>备份文件</text><text>{{preview.backupContacts}} 位联系人 · {{preview.backupRelationships}} 条关系</text></view>
    <text>恢复将完整替换当前账号的本机资料和关系，不会合并同名联系人。</text>
    <view class="app-state app-state--warning" wx:if="{{restoreNeedsSync}}">本次恢复涉及公开资料，需要联网同步。明确失败时会尝试回滚；状态不确定时保留数据并提示重试。</view>
    <button class="danger-button" bindtap="restoreData" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认恢复</button>
  </view>
  <view class="section-title">最近生成记录</view><view class="app-help">仅保留当前账号最近 5 条记录，不保存多个文件副本。生成或完成分享不代表文件已安全另存，忘记密码无法恢复。</view>
  <view class="backup-history-row" wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="fileName"><view>{{item.timeLabel}} · {{item.shared ? '已完成分享' : '已生成，未完成分享'}}</view><text>{{item.contacts}} 位联系人 · {{item.relationships}} 条关系</text><text>{{item.fileName}}</text></view>
  <view class="app-help" wx:if="{{!history.length}}">暂无本机生成记录。</view>
  <privacy-popup />
</view>
